        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-04T21:14:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When Char and Imprisoned Rogue are both in play, does Char do a total of 5 damage [(2+2) + 1] or 6 damage [(2+1) + (2+1)]?</p><p>It seems to me like Char ought to be doing 2 separate instances of damage, each of which gets boosted by the Rogue.&nbsp; However, unlike many cards which act that way, both of Char's damage statements are in a single sentence, so some local players disagree.&nbsp; Can I get clarification on this?</p>",
