        "raw": "Anyone who deals multiple instances of damage will have every instance boosted by a damage buff - Fanatic has been mentioned, of course. Another good example is Tempest&#39;s Vicious Cyclone, where you would normally deal one damage for each card discarded (up to a maximum of three cards), but say he has a total of +1 damage, that means [i]two[/i] damage for each card discarded. If the Cyclone is on the villain with the highest hp (usually the main villain, obviously) and he&#39;s wearing his Shackles and is buffed by, say, Galvanise and Inspiring Presence, that&#39;ll be [i]five[/i] damage per card. Six if the target happens to be Voss. So that&#39;s an automatic eighteen damage (assuming Voss has no soak) at the start of Tempest&#39;s turn, before he&#39;s even played a card, provided he discards three :D.\n\nSomeone like Char, the Abominable Snowman, or the &quot;Diplomatic&quot; Envoy, already nasty as they deal two lots of two damage to a target, are made all the worse if they can get their damage buffed by even one point :(.\n",
